        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "Create engaging social media posts for Alpine Peak Roofing that drive traffic to blog content and generate leads."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "Create social media posts for this blog: \"{{ $('Supabase - Get Blog Post').first().json.title }}\"\n\nBlog excerpt: {{ $('Supabase - Get Blog Post').first().json.excerpt }}\nKeywords: {{ $('Supabase - Get Blog Post').first().json.seo_keywords.join(', ') }}\n\nCreate posts for:\n1. **Facebook** (casual, engaging, 2-3 sentences + CTA)\n2. **LinkedIn** (professional, industry insights, hashtags)\n3. **Instagram** (visual focus, emojis, local hashtags)\n4. **Twitter/X** (concise, engaging, hashtags)\n\nEach post should:\n- Include link to blog\n- Use relevant hashtags\n- Have clear call-to-action\n- Mention Denver/Colorado when relevant\n- Drive engagement and website traffic\n\nReturn as JSON:\n{\n  \"facebook\": {\n    \"text\": \"post content\",\n    \"hashtags\": [\"#hashtag1\", \"#hashtag2\"]\n  },\n  \"linkedin\": {\n    \"text\": \"post content\",\n    \"hashtags\": [\"#hashtag1\", \"#hashtag2\"]\n  },\n  \"instagram\": {\n    \"text\": \"post content\",\n    \"hashtags\": [\"#hashtag1\", \"#hashtag2\"]\n  },\n  \"twitter\": {\n    \"text\": \"post content\",\n    \"hashtags\": [\"#hashtag1\", \"#hashtag2\"]\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7,
          "maxTokens": 600
        }
      },
